SUMMARY:3 Days in September
DTSTART:20261114T030000Z
DTEND:20261114T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T030000Z
UID:6waCfIUvnw
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 75 mins (1h15m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle P
 resented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. When her fiancé’s 
 mistress crashes her wedding\, Bianca flees the scene\, launching a real-t
 ime odyssey of chaos and eventual liberation through an off-season seaside
  resort.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival
 -seattle-13th-edition/3-days-in-september\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
