BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Last Transhumance
DTSTART:20261114T200000Z
DTEND:20261114T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T200000Z
UID:LBqMYJpCB4
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle P
 resented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. Filmed in six countrie
 s during fifteen years\, The Last Transhumance takes us into the world of 
 shepherds who walk with their animals very long distances in search of foo
 d: an ancient way of life not compatible with the modern world.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle-13th-editi
 on/the-last-transhumance\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kontinental '25
DTSTART:20261114T215000Z
DTEND:20261114T235500Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T215000Z
UID:mNIKu9HDPg
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. After a municipal wor
 ker in Transylvania oversees an eviction that goes wrong\, she spirals int
 o an existential crisis that forces her to confront her place in a frenzie
 d world.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival
 -seattle-13th-edition/kontinental-25\n\nEstimated start: 14:05
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traffic
DTSTART:20261115T001000Z
DTEND:20261115T022500Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T001000Z
UID:2G5oQPEH6C
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. A young Romanian coup
 le working in Western Europe orchestrates an ambitious art museum heist af
 ter the woman is assaulted.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/rom
 anian-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/traffic\n\nEstimated start: 16:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:R.M.N. (2022)
DTSTART:20261115T030500Z
DTEND:20261115T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T030500Z
UID:xXdK9xZgvT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle 
 Presented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. When a multi-ethnic T
 ransylvanian village hires Sri Lankan workers at the local bakery\, latent
  xenophobia and historic tribal resentments explode\, fracturing the commu
 nity's veneer of peace.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romania
 n-film-festival-seattle-13th-edition/rmn\n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
